# .gitignore RIENG cho repo The Brain (khi lab/ dung mot minh tren GitHub).
# Ban o goc du an van giu nguyen — hai ban phai noi cung mot thu.

# --- BI MAT: khong bao gio commit -------------------------------------------
config/api_keys.json
config/credentials*.json
config/passview.json
**/api_keys.json
**/credentials*.json
**/tai_khoan.json
**/email_cong_tac.json
**/mo_them_tai_khoan.json
**/tele_bridge.json
**/telethon*.session
**/telethon*_hash.txt
*.env
!template.env
nguon_config.json
TAI_KHOAN_VA_MA_KHOA.txt
config/gh_token.txt

# --- HO SO TRINH DUYET: co phien dang nhap ----------------------------------
.browser_*/
browser_backup_*/

# --- KHO + DU LIEU: to, may tu sinh lai duoc --------------------------------
nao.db
nao.db-*
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
data/
data_khung/
downloaded_codes/
quant/data/
quant/tai_lieu/
quant/pseud.zip
*.parquet
*.zip
*.pdf
*.docx

# --- KET QUA CHAY: giu .md/.json de tra lai duoc, bo log va bang tho --------
reports/*.log
reports/*.jsonl
reports/*.csv
reports/*.htm
reports/*.html
reports/*.prof
*.err
*.out
# nhat_ky/ KHONG chan: du an co chu y commit ban giao phien
# (150 commit tu 30/08). Chan no la noi sai su that.
backups/

# --- TRANG THAI RUNTIME ------------------------------------------------------
DUNG_LAI
dieu_phoi.lock
.dieu_phoi.lock.*

# --- PYTHON ------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/

# mau_thu/ PHAI len repo: bo mau .mq5 cho phien cloud do duoc
!mau_thu/

# cau noi hai may: cau hinh + ban duyet + cong tac dung khan la cua TUNG MAY (qwen/cau_may.py)
config/cau.json
config/cau_duyet.json
CAU_DUNG

# Cau noi hai may: khoa lan TESTER la trang thai CUA MAY, khong phai cua repo.
# Day no len se lam may kia tuong lan dang ban vinh vien.
viec/.khoa_tester
viec/**/*.tam
.venv/

# cai dat Claude Code RIENG cua may (hook thu: b cau hook-cai)
.claude/settings.local.json

# giam sat may nha (nhan/may_nha.py): MOI MAU 5 phut o lai may, chi mau tom tat / bao cao moi len git
nhat_ky/may_nha_mau.jsonl*
# link rieng cua chu du an (nhom ngoai, link moi): repo la PUBLIC nen KHONG dua len git (nhan/link_nguon.py)
link_rieng.txt
config/link_rieng.txt
du_lieu_cao/
# BOT / CHUONG TRINH CUA NGUOI KHAC: repo la PUBLIC. EA nhi phan (.ex5 / .ex4), dll, bo cai dat, tep nen tai tu
# MQL5 / Telegram / Drive chi o MAY NHA (du_lieu_cao/), KHONG BAO GIO len git: ban quyen cua nguoi ban + tai ve cong khai
# la phat tan. Nhanh nhi phan cua ea_tho chi COPY tam vao terminal de tester chay roi xoa (nhan/ea_tho._chay_voi_slot).
*.ex5
*.ex4
*.dll
*.exe
*.msi
*.rar
*.7z
